CREATED:20190807T015811Z
DESCRIPTION:Join WiCS + PwC (PricewaterhouseCoopers) at our ice cream socia
 l! PwC will be giving a presentation on networking tips\, such as creating 
 an elevator pitch\, writing follow up emails\, and general career fair prep
 aration advice! Then\, network with the PwC engineers over FREEBIRDS dinner
  and ICE CREAM! The Career Fair is coming up soon\, so make sure to attend 
 this career fair prep event! \n\nStart the school year off strong and join 
 PwC for a "Get the Scoop" information session.  We will discuss opportuniti
 es for women in our new PwC Labs group.  PwC Labs is focused on standardizi
 ng\, automating\, delivering tools and processes and exploring emerging tec
 hnologies that drive efficiency and enable our people to re-imagine the pos
 sible.  We will present both internship and full time opportunities for Lon
 ghorns\, as well as indulge in a ice cream networking social.  Please join 
 us on September 5th from 5:30-7:00 p.m. Attire is casual. We look forward t
 o seeing you there!\n\nDINNER WILL BE PROVIDED!
LAST-MODIFIED:20190828T222444Z
LOCATION:GDC 4.302
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:WiCS + PwC : How To Network + Ice Cream Social
TRANSP:OPAQUE
