 ruary 4th and 5th! We will have both beginner and intermediate technical wo
 rkshops in the days leading up to the hackathon + a 24-hour hackathon start
 ing on Saturday! You’ll have the opportunity to attend company talks\, meet
  sponsors one on one\, play arcade games\, and WIN PRIZES! WiCS Hacks is op
 en to ALL women and non-binary students in high school or college. All skil
 l levels are welcome and we are beginner friendly!<br><br>👾 Register now!&
 nbsp\;<a href="https://tinyurl.com/wicshacks23" style="background-color: va
 r(--textfield-surface)\;" id="ow1765" __is_owner="true">tinyurl.com/wicshac
 ks23</a><span style="background-color: var(--textfield-surface)\; color: va
 r(--on-surface)\;">&nbsp\;👾</span>
